# <%= it.name %>

<% if (it.description) { %><%= it.description %><% } else { %>A physics-based game built with the DownDraft Engine.<% } %>

## Getting Started

```bash
# Install dependencies
bun install

# Start dev server
npm run dev

# Build for production
npm run build

# Export for distribution
npm run export
```

## Project Structure

```
src/          Game source code
  main.tsx    Renderer entry (game module mount)
  native-entry.ts  Native runtime entry (draft dev)
assets/       Game assets (models, textures, shaders)
downdraft.config.json   Engine configuration (physics-rapier plugin enabled)
```

## Plugins

- **@downdraft/engine/libraries/physics-rapier** — Rapier physics backend for rigid body simulation, colliders, and raycasting.

## Engine

Built with [DownDraft Engine](https://github.com/downdraft-engine) — a TypeScript-first game engine on WebGPU — native runtime (Bun + SDL + wgpu).
